 "note": "A Craft Pages entry (hero, text, quote, call to action): \"Sections apart\" splits the text into blocks around the quote, \"Where we work first\" adds a call to action under the hero. Both are noticeably different.",
 "draft": "title: Winter garden care\npageBuilder:\n  - type: hero\n    heading: Winter garden care\n    subheading: Four visits between November and February set the garden up for spring.\n    image: [8]\n  - type: text\n    text: |-\n      Winter is when a garden is set up for the year. Most of the work that matters in June is done in the cold months.\n\n      ## The visits\n\n      We come in November to cut back, in December to mulch, in January to prune the fruit trees and in February to feed the beds.\n\n      ## Who it suits\n\n      Gardens with mixed borders, fruit trees or young hedges, anywhere we work.\n  - type: quoteBlock\n    quote: They left the garden tidy but not bare, which is exactly what we wanted.\n    attribution: A client in Hexham\n  - type: cta\n    heading: Book a winter visit\n    ctaText: Tell us about your garden and we will suggest a plan.",
